        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SS44R5BU32D-S,  4\" x 4\"x 5/8\" Radius Ball Bearing Stainless Steel Hinge with Security Tabs</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2), matching Stainless Steel flathead, Phillips Drive #10 x 3/4\" wood screws. These extra security door hinges have locking tabs that join the 2 hinge leaves together when door is closed. This holds a closed door in place even if the door hinges are tampered with (if hinge pins are removed or cut).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 4 Inch Security Stainless Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Radius: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.083\" (Residential)</li>\r\n<li>Zig-Zag Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SS445B-specifciations.pdf?v=1704262406\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana SS44R5BU32D-S Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
